    "title": "Dixon City Government Applications Available - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tom Katz ,\n2 days ago The Dixon City Clerk’s office has opened nomination packets for residents interested in running in the 2027 municipal elections. Positions on the ballot include mayor and two seats on the Dixon City Council. Prospective candidates must complete the required paperwork and meet eligibility rules before filing deadlines set by the city. Read full article",
